  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量工作台-资质管理\",\"巨量营销-应用、小程序与游戏\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量工作台\",\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"查询鸿蒙应用列表，支持按多种条件进行筛选，如账号ID、应用状态、发布时间等。可通过【获取Access token】接口获取授权access_token。返回码和返回信息详见【附录-返回码】。\",\"id\":\"tools.harmony_app_list.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tools/app_management/harmony_app_list/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1826461039581386\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"tools.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"appendix.return_code.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"此接口的返回码和返回信息需要参考该文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1826461039581386\",\"title\":\"查询鸿蒙应用列表\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-muPhHlgc\">查询鸿蒙应用列表</p><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1824285038959963%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1743864733602830%2C%22id%22%3A%22EUTYJ%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-w8nthUzS\" id=\"h346b9f0-w8nthUzS\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-YGxvzZlE\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/app_management/harmony_app_list/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/tools/app_management/harmony_app_list/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1826461039581386\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-BKTiGuZG\" id=\"h346b9f0-BKTiGuZG\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-8BH63jAu\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-LRSHs1DT\" id=\"h346b9f0-LRSHs1DT\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-jtKsMo89\" id=\"h346b9f0-jtKsMo89\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-R5jHY01i\">账号ID，支持升级版/旧版巨量引擎工作台/巨量营销账户id入参</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-aA22TMJS\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-GV6VmGQP\"><code>BP</code>：升级版/旧版巨量引擎工作台组织</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-GhhJHMTF\"><code>AD</code>：巨量营销账号</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-uTHlScUz\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">页数</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page_size</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vDZm8WZa\">页面大小</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filtering</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-4nahx8vwxje000\">过滤条件</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">search_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">搜索类型 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-iYORlJJ0\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-d2UQTRWF\"><code>ALL</code> 查询全部，包括创建和被共享的应用</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-nRpGeS0K\"><code>CREATE_ONLY</code> 只查询客户创建的应用</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-B3EFAPj6\"><code>SHARE_ONLY</code>  只查询被共享的应用</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">search_key</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-FDA1T1nO\">搜索关键字\napp_id或者应用名称</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-OBGrA36m\">可以为空，可以传中文/英文，长度不超过50</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">status</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> 查询应用状态，默认值: <code>ALL</code><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-XS4WhTcU\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-gjB6cg4Y\"><code>ALL</code> 所有状态</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-7CqZZoJP\"><code>AUDIT_DOING</code> 审核中</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-GUXaS9qr\"><code>AUDIT_REJECTED</code> 审核失败</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-afUdso0G\"><code>AUDIT_ACCEPTED</code> 审核成功</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-XqglMcOj\"><code>ENABLE</code> 已发布</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-LE1Qy8Uw\"> </p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 20px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">publish_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-VgKreegR\">按发布时间查询的时间范围</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">start_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">发布起始时间，格式：%Y-%m-%d</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">end_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">发布结束时间，格式：%Y-%m-%d</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_asset_query_scope</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">资产来源范围，<span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">不传默认全部，</span>可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-3x6zfq70qns000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-22plyrkg7r7k00\"><code>ACCOCUNT</code>仅查询来源营销账户创建的应用<br/> </li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-16lhs41kmnls00\"><code>ALL</code>所有来源，即包含巨量营销平台和升级版工作台上传的应用<br/> </li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-o0wsz22re8000\"><code>GROUP</code>仅查询账户直属升级版工作台团队的应用<br/> </li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">asset_generation</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">资产版本类型，不传默认全部，如需投放巨量营销智擎版，需要筛选<code>OC_USABLE</code>，可选值:  <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-aqvfoqj7oyo00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1bcrudcjmrk00\"><code>LEGACY</code> 旧版资产</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-e10jes4yab400\"><code>OC_USABLE</code> 新版资产</li></ul></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-BFjfKlVH\" id=\"h346b9f0-BFjfKlVH\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2F2%2Ftools%2Fapp_management%2Fharmony_app_list%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20GET%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20